      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Mose guri mu/aywaáts, «Ahaá gár kuúng da/i usa ót a milá as aníng? Hamí geera a tsiní AAKOÓ MUNGÚ mukós sleémeero burngwa qeeruuwós i haniís nee tari aaruuse.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Mose nee bariiseedár mibeeri faanqw ar múk Israeli tari kií/ baraá xafaay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo AAKOÓ MUNGÚ fur'a ngiri fukuku'uús ar gaanslaay, xooyaangw nguri húp baraá tlawtá wa ale, nee iri huuhu'ún bihhaá xafaay. Yaamaá xooyaangwí aa alqaát bartí wa tleemu ay tiqá', a adór aa'aá hee awa looár wák, baráy wa tleemu ay gawa tlenaango a miíta wak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy muu xweera gina tlatla/aangw tleéhh as tawa xooyángw burumburin, umuú heewo oo kílo kumuú wák gaa ayká i kaahh, kuri intláh bihhér xafay'ín as kuwa kahaasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala qoomár fu'unaá yaariir niwa kumiitiya' nee dír fu'unaydá' ngira faaki'iiká /aymaro, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ muu guri slaáhh ar slahhtá ur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe didá' kari bay Kibrot-hata'afa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:34",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kibrot-hata'afa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gídaabárós a /aantaá múk fu'unaay gaa ilatleeruus.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " asma múk haayír fu'unaá koóm kuna didií foliít. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu iri tláy Kibrot-hata'afár wa ale ay Haseroti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
